        "original_id": "446515e0-eb7a-5b14-b379-2900f14cc3ae",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: plant taxonomy, genera, species counts\n- Products: Centaurium, Dacrydium\n- Organizations: Gentianaceae, Chironieae, Chironiinae, Podocarpaceae\n\nFacts:\n- Centaurium, also called centaury, is a genus of 20 species.\n- Centaurium belongs to the gentian family Gentianaceae, the tribe Chironieae, and the subtribe Chironiinae.\n- Dacrydium is a genus of conifers in the podocarp family Podocarpaceae.\n- Dacrydium currently has 16 recognized species of evergreen dioecious trees and shrubs.",
